WEBVTT

01:35.518 --> 01:37.937
JOJO'S BIZARRE ADVENTURE
DIAMOND IS UNBREAKABLE

01:39.230 --> 01:42.524
<i>These faceless gazes pass by one another</i>

01:42.901 --> 01:46.195
<i>A wound to the heart changes our everyday</i>

01:46.446 --> 01:50.946
<i>Encounters without boundaries
The bizarre is our normal U-yeh</i>

01:53.411 --> 01:56.747
<i>These ordinary mornings,
we're laughing on the surface</i>

01:56.831 --> 02:00.417
<i>Mysteries drawn to each other,
identity still unknown</i>

02:00.502 --> 02:05.002
<i>Without a heads up,
it's quietly lurking somewhere in this town</i>

02:09.636 --> 02:14.136
<i>Although we bicker and complain
In the end, we celebrate</i>

02:16.685 --> 02:20.063
<i>Dancing through the everyday</i>

02:20.146 --> 02:24.646
<i>Crazy Noisy Bizarre Town</i>

02:36.913 --> 02:41.167
EPISODE 11
CHILI PEPPER, PART 1

10:30.553 --> 10:32.513
MORIOH LANDMARK #4
MORIOH GRAND HOTEL
HOW TO GET THERE: FROM TERMINAL #1,
TAKE THE "MORIOH GRAND
SWIMMING AREA" BUS
TO "MORIOH GRAND HOTEL".

10:32.597 --> 10:34.557
SURROUNDED BY EXTRAVAGANT VILLAS,
THE MORIOH GRAND HOTEL OOZES
ELEGANCE AND OLD-WORLD CHARM,
AND FOR YEARS HAS BEEN
THE BELOVED GO-TO SPOT
FOR TRAVELERS TO MORIOH.
BESIDES ITS ACCOMMODATIONS,
THE HOTEL IS KNOWN FOR SERVING
MORIOH BEEF TONGUE TO CROWDS
OF ADORING REGULARS
AND TRAVELERS ALIKE.

23:38.966 --> 23:42.052
EPISODE 12
CHILI PEPPER, PART 2
